  "description": "Here is a 5-line summary of the conversation:\n\n1. A Vue.js analytics dashboard was built with a `MetricsDashboard.vue` component featuring KPI cards, filters, and data tables.\n2. A responsive `DailyChart.vue` was created using pure SVG with line/area charts, hover tooltips, axis labels, and a `ResizeObserver`.\n3. An `index.vue` wrapper was added to expose the analytics module cleanly.\n4. `Desktop.vue` was updated to register the `AnalyticsDashboard` component, enabling it to open as a dockview panel tab.\n5. The dashboard supports both regular and admin views, with breakdowns by model, user, and project, plus date range filtering with quick presets.",
